+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+This project's authentication system uses argon2id for password hashing. argon2id was selected as a modern, memory-hard algorithm that is resistant to GPU and ASIC attacks, combining resistance to side-channel attacks with efficient computation, making it a strong choice for securely storing user credentials in production.
